{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/c4787e523f0f124d3d63e7713a14adf9.poster.avif?t=1759851992\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/c4787e523f0f124d3d63e7713a14adf9.webm?t=1759851992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/c4787e523f0f124d3d63e7713a14adf9.mp4?t=1759851992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world devastated by past wars is threatened once again. When a former comrade asks for help, Happy the Robot reluctantly agrees to face Layla \u2014 once a friend, now a dangerous enemy they thought they had destroyed. The mission: ascend Layla\u2019s tower and destroy the last copy of her consciousness before she can be downloaded into a new body and enact her devious plan.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochrome Heights is a tough-as-nails 2D platformer featuring classic run, jump, and slide mechanics \u2014 but most importantly, a distinctive color-swapping mechanic that involves phasing between black and white platforms to climb the tower. With crisp pixel art and a modern retro-style experience, the game is inspired by early Super Mario Bros. and Mega Man titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/664825b27284020e4432609fa5d6aa55.avif?t=1759851992\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional tough-as-nails platforming meets a novel phase mechanic where players must swap between black and white to avoid hazards and land on platforms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, simple controls that allow players to blaze forward with speed and momentum, or take it slow and patiently progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-focused, single-player story mode chock full of brain-breaking platforming. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn character portraits during dialogue that compliment the crisp pixel art. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original music score by Bent Neatly that drives players forward during intense gameplay and provides a relaxing backdrop for story moments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots. Lots of robots. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Climb Commenced","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/8ba0de6163e53b010adabfdde969f5618cc62f88.jpg"},{"name":"Basil Befriended","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/8e35f367b933a9ae4248c3af4400da85fdc73f6a.jpg"},{"name":"Assignment Accepted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/cc5520d7fa20a2dad26fe874f1f1aa0be2f79b7f.jpg"},{"name":"Threat Terminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/84715c208bd7b6c506e23c81abd907dd1c8ae5c4.jpg"},{"name":"Friend Felled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/1c303a4b5c218847d7cf3fb35b6c450b98263a33.jpg"},{"name":"Awareness Ascertained","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/292635a7c788b59eda1bc3105411a7d5330d6452.jpg"},{"name":"Shelter Secured","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/0b39ba293d3f25d4170e5462df5e716b59d820d1.jpg"},{"name":"Conflict Created","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/86b8ea4d15b0e3b9d97f1bbd4feacf526877a4ba.jpg"},{"name":"Force Fractured","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/19ea121886828fa871b88c450d813a2cbec125aa.jpg"},{"name":"Rearrangement Realized","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2336210/8ff77c35c1a4233e9e6e368f6e73db2595d56d59.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2336210?t=1759851992","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759851992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759851992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759851992","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game deals with darker themes of war, violence, and a future that has been ravaged by climate change."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2912160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/c4787e523f0f124d3d63e7713a14adf9.poster.avif?t=1759851992\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/c4787e523f0f124d3d63e7713a14adf9.webm?t=1759851992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336210/extras/c4787e523f0f124d3d63e7713a14adf9.mp4?t=1759851992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi